an8.30:12.3 | S: Well then, Anuruddha, for the next rainy season residence you should stay right here in the land of the Cetīs in the Park of the East-Raftered Hall.” | T: “Now, then, Anuruddha, you are to stay right here among the Cetis for the coming Rains Retreat.”
an8.30:12.4 | S: “Yes, sir,” Anuruddha replied. | T: “As you say, venerable sir,” Ven. Anuruddha responded to him.
